{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"黄仁勋·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"jensen-huang","categoryLabel":"黄仁勋","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/12_jensen-huang/4_major-works","introMarkdown":"# 代表成就\n\n本卷把黄仁勋的\"代表作\"落到可核验的产品、平台与里程碑上，而不是泛泛地颂扬。与谈论生平脉络的《生平与时代》、谈论核心贡献之\"为什么重要\"的《核心贡献》不同，这一卷回答的是一个更具体的问题：黄仁勋和英伟达究竟造出了哪些东西，在哪一年，达到了什么样的规模与数字。\n\n线索有三条。第一条是英伟达这家公司本身：一九九三年三人在加州一家 Denny's 餐厅里立项，三十余年后于二〇二四年六月二十日以约 3.34 万亿美元的市值短暂登顶全球，二〇二五年十月又成为史上首家市值突破 5 万亿美元的公司。第二条是硬件与软件的双轮——从一九九九年被英伟达冠以\"GPU\"之名的 GeForce 256，到二〇〇六年随 G80 架构问世、把显卡变成通用并行处理器的 CUDA，再到 Volta V100、Ampere A100、Hopper H100、Blackwell B200 这一代代数据中心芯片，以及围绕 CUDA 长出的庞大软件生态。第三条是平台化的跨越：二〇一六年黄仁勋亲手把第一台 DGX-1 送到 OpenAI，此后英伟达不再只卖芯片，而是用 NVLink、DGX、CUDA-X、DRIVE、Isaac、Omniverse 把自己变成一套从芯片到软件的全栈基础设施。\n\n三章正是沿这三条线展开：第一章讲公司从餐厅到万亿俱乐部的成长与估值逻辑；第二章讲 GPU 产品线与 CUDA 生态这对软硬组合如何构成护城河；第三章讲 DGX 系统与全栈平台如何让英伟达坐稳 AI 基础设施的中心。每一处年份、型号与数字都尽量给出依据，读者可据此追溯到一手来源。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nvidia-the-company","title":"英伟达公司","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/nvidia-the-company","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"building-nvidia","title":"缔造英伟达","url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/nvidia-the-company/building-nvidia"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-trillion-dollar-company","title":"万亿市值的公司","url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/nvidia-the-company/the-trillion-dollar-company"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"gpu-and-cuda","title":"GPU与CUDA","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/gpu-and-cuda","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-gpu-product-line","title":"GPU产品线","url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/gpu-and-cuda/the-gpu-product-line"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cuda-ecosystem","title":"CUDA生态系统","url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/gpu-and-cuda/cuda-ecosystem"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-platforms","title":"AI平台","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/ai-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dgx-and-data-centers","title":"DGX与数据中心","url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/ai-platforms/dgx-and-data-centers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-full-stack-platform","title":"全栈式的平台","url":"/c/people/jensen-huang/major-works/ai-platforms/the-full-stack-platform"}]}]}